translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_d1f38b56:

    # "I want to hold him and tell him that everything will be okay."
    "我想抱着他，告诉他一切都会好起来的。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1136
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_e246420e:

    # robin "Um..."
    robin "嗯..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1137
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_8e078ddb:

    # robin "I'm kind of tired, so if you want to go back that's fine."
    robin "我有点累了，所以如果你想回去也没关系。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1138
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_2b31c75a:

    # pro "Oh, right."
    pro "哦，对了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1139
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_93d5acac:

    # pro "Yeah, we should definitely go back."
    pro "是的，我们一定要回去。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1140
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_1c380cc3:

    # robin "Okay, let's pack up and go."
    robin "好吧，我们收拾行李出发吧。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1142
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_2bffde70:

    # robin "Thanks for listening and letting me talk about this."
    robin "感谢您的聆听并让我谈论这个问题。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1144
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_cbf3d343:

    # "We pack up and head back to the car."
    "我们收拾好东西，回到车上。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1145
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_7d12e478:

    # robin "This was a good day, wasn't it?"
    robin "这真是美好的一天，不是吗？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1146
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_677d0104:

    # pro "Definitely, one of the best days we've had."
    pro "毫无疑问，这是我们度过的最美好的日子之一。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1147
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_a5ac5a61:

    # robin "Yeah, I'm glad I decided to come here."
    robin "是的，我很高兴我决定来这里。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1148
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_5082b2c1:

    # "I'm glad he came here."
    "我很高兴他来到这里。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1149
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_f9dff4cb:

    # "We drive back, the radio playing softly in the background."
    "我们开车回去，收音机在后台轻柔地播放着。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1150
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_1aeb4c2b:

    # "I'm still processing what Robin told me."
    "我仍在处理罗宾告诉我的话。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1151
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_eff7bc22:

    # "God, what a fucking asshole."
    "天哪，真是个混蛋。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1152
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_3b4179f0:

    # "I can't believe someone would do that to him."
    "我不敢相信有人会这样对他。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1153
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_7052fe1a:

    # "Robin is so sweet and innocent, it makes me sick to think that people would prey on him like that."
    "罗宾是如此的可爱和天真，一想到人们会这样攻击他就让我感到恶心。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1154
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_c870ddbb:

    # "I need to protect him."
    "我需要保护他。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1156
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_c33f0da3:

    # "After a short drive, we arrive home and head inside our apartment."
    "经过一小段车程后，我们到达家并走进我们的公寓。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1158
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_af480cf8:

    # robin "Well, I'm going to take a shower and then head to bed."
    robin "好吧，我要去洗个澡，然后上床睡觉。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1159
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_f241d8fd:

    # robin "Today was a lot of fun, thanks again for everything."
    robin "今天很有趣，再次感谢所做的一切。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1160
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_c4b65fe1:

    # pro "Of course, I'm glad we got to spend the day together."
    pro "当然，我很高兴我们能一起度过这一天。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1161
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_1c7aa342:

    # robin "Me too, goodnight."
    robin "我也是，晚安。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1162
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_44d8b4ac:

    # pro "Goodnight."
    pro "晚安。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1164
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_5ab325d5:

    # "I watch him walk into the bathroom and hear the shower turn on."
    "我看着他走进浴室，听到淋浴打开的声音。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1166
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_419d1b09:

    # "I enter my room and pass out immediately after I lay down on my bed."
    "我走进自己的房间，躺在床上后立即昏倒了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1167
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_d2b847d3:

    # "Today was fun but exhausting."
    "今天很有趣，但也很累。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1172
translate chinese_simplified story_beat3_17b738de:

    # system "{color=#FF5454}Progression Level{/color} has increased"
    system "{color=#FF5454}进步级别{/color}已提高"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1190
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_aa0d0ae2:

    # "Fuck, there's a really bad thunderstorm outside..."
    "妈的，外面真的下雷雨了……"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1191
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_9526ab0f:

    # "I'm sitting at my desk, trying to focus on my work, but the lights keep flickering."
    "我坐在办公桌前，试图集中精力工作，但灯一直闪烁。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1192
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_2cb73df8:

    # pro "What if the power goes out...?"
    pro "如果停电了怎么办...？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1193
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_fc3f0bec:

    # pro "Honestly I'm not even going to risk this..."
    pro "老实说，我什至不会冒这个风险......"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1194
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_49178709:

    # "I turn off my computer and unplug it from the outlets to prevent a sudden power surge."
    "我关闭计算机并将其从插座上拔下，以防止突然出现电涌。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1195
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_f599b714:

    # pro "I guess if I can't do work, I could try chilling in the living room..."
    pro "我想如果我不能工作的话，我可以尝试在客厅里放松一下......"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1197
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_7a3e8f69:

    # "I leave my room and see Robin already sitting on the couch."
    "我离开房间，看到罗宾已经坐在沙发上。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1199
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_24394ad0:

    # robin "Hey, this storm is really starting to ramp up huh..."
    robin "哎呀，这场风暴真的开始猛烈起来了啊……"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1200
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_54c0f3bf:

    # pro "Yeah, it's definitely pretty bad out there."
    pro "是的，外面的情况肯定很糟糕。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1201
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_5fb822bb:

    # pro "How are you holding up?"
    pro "你还好吗？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1202
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_1ef6802b:

    # robin "I'm fine, just didn't want to be locked up in my room in case the power went out..."
    robin "我很好，只是不想被锁在房间里以防停电……"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1203
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_facdc90c:

    # pro "Ah, I had the same idea."
    pro "啊，我也有同样的想法。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1204
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_98595b97:

    # pro "It's not like we can get anything done anyway, right?"
    pro "无论如何我们也不能完成任何事情，对吧？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1206
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_64a8ddb7:

    # robin "Well, at least it gives us a chance to hang out together."
    robin "好吧，至少它给了我们一个一起出去玩的机会。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1207
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_9b6ef14a:

    # pro "Mind if I sit with you then?"
    pro "介意我和你坐在一起吗？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1208
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_b4dcea1a:

    # robin "Not at all, go ahead."
    robin "一点也不，继续吧。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1210
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_8f6120d3:

    # "I plop down on the couch next to Robin and get comfortable."
    "我在罗宾旁边的沙发上坐下来，感觉很舒服。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1212
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_9d413682:

    # robin "So, do you think the power is going to go out?"
    robin "那么，你认为电力会消失吗？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1214
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_94a704f7:

    # pro "Considering the way this storm is going, it's likely."
    pro "考虑到这场风暴的发展方式，这是有可能的。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1216
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_7d0ca308:

    # robin "Hopefully not for long, though..."
    robin "但希望不会太久……"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1217
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_cdbb1e49:

    # robin "Do you have any candles or flashlights?"
    robin "你有蜡烛或手电筒吗？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1219
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_7590b815:

    # pro "Nope..."
    pro "没有..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1220
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_9199df78:

    # pro "But the apartment does have one or two backup lights that are hooked up to a generator."
    pro "但公寓确实有一两个连接到发电机的备用灯。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1221
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_99fe111e:

    # pro "Even if the power goes out, we should have some light until it comes back on."
    pro "即使停电了，我们也应该有一些光，直到它重新打开。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1223
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_9546838f:

    # robin "That's good..."
    robin "那挺好的..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1224
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_387bf87f:

    # robin "You know, I've been thinking about something lately."
    robin "你知道吗，我最近一直在思考一些事情。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1226
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_e5150d67:

    # pro "Oh? What's that?"
    pro "哦？那是什么？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1228
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_5292875c:

    # robin "Well, um... maybe this is a good time to ask you this since we're already talking."
    robin "嗯，嗯……也许现在是问你这个问题的好时机，因为我们已经在谈论了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1230
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_23122fab:

    # pro "Uh huh, what are you referring to exactly?"
    pro "呃呃，你具体指的是什么？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1232
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_06bc7a11:

    # robin "Remember how I told you about that stalker at my old place..."
    robin "还记得我在老地方告诉过你那个跟踪狂的事吗……"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1233
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_247d53fe:

    # robin "You know, at the beach trip."
    robin "你知道，在海滩旅行中。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1235
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_edabcdbc:

    # pro "Of course I remember. Have you seen him around here or something?"
    pro "我当然记得。你在这里见过他吗？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1237
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_fcb99189:

    # robin "No, but..."
    robin "不，但是……"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1238
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_205abf8d:

    # robin "The other night, I heard someone knock on our apartment door."
    robin "那天晚上，我听到有人敲我们公寓的门。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1240
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_9af42d31:

    # pro "What the fuck?"
    pro "搞什么鬼？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1241
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_917a3fe6:

    # pro "Did you get a look at them?"
    pro "你看过他们吗？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1243
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_efb2cfa0:

    # robin "No, but I was really freaked out."
    robin "不，但我真的吓坏了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1244
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_ea30bb63:

    # robin "What if it's the same guy?"
    robin "万一是同一个人呢？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1245
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_a11a4502:

    # robin "What if he was able to find me and he's just-"
    robin "如果他能够找到我并且他只是——"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1247
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_fc2d0705:

    # pro "Hey, it's okay."
    pro "嘿，没关系。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1248
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_09ee27bc:

    # pro "Even if it's him, I'll be here to protect you."
    pro "就算是他，我也会在这里保护你。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1253
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_4d08e9be:

    # robin "But what if he brings others with him?"
    robin "但如果他带着其他人怎么办？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1258
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_7446d679:

    # robin "Or tries to force himself into our apartment?"
    robin "或者试图强行进入我们的公寓？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1263
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_306014b9:

    # pro "Hey, slow down Robin..."
    pro "嘿，罗宾慢点……"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1264
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_e883f529:

    # pro "I promise that won't happen."
    pro "我保证这不会发生。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1265
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_aaf2df2d:

    # pro "They don't know you live here..."
    pro "他们不知道你住在这里..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1266
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_7a45b696:

    # pro "And I'm here too, I'll protect you."
    pro "我也在这里，我会保护你。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1268
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_4d65bd03:

    # "He looks at me and smiles."
    "他看着我微笑。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1269
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_531cbf7d:

    # robin "Okay..."
    robin "好的..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1273
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_69b537b0:

    # "Suddenly, the room goes pitch black."
    "突然，房间里一片漆黑。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1276
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_cdfdacbe:

    # "I feel Robin grab my chest and fall on top of me."
    "我感觉罗宾抓住了我的胸口，倒在了我身上。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1277
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_821cd32e:

    # robin "Oh my god, the power went out!"
    robin "天哪，停电了！"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1279
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_fd08368f:

    # "He's shaking. I can feel his heart pounding against my chest."
    "他在发抖。我能感觉到他的心脏在我的胸口上狂跳。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1280
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_8f42ae5c:

    # pro "It's okay, Robin. I'm right here."
    pro "没关系，罗宾。我就在这里。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1284
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_3bc9df68:

    # "After a few moments, the backup generator kicks in and a dim light above the couch turns on."
    "过了一会儿，备用发电机启动，沙发上方的昏暗灯光亮起。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1285
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_7cc2e32e:

    # pro "R-robin..."
    pro "R-罗宾..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1286
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_59635525:

    # "He's still gripping onto my shirt, his breathing heavy and panicked."
    "他仍然抓着我的衬衫，呼吸沉重而惊慌。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1287
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_2a21316c:

    # robin "Sorry, I just..."
    robin "抱歉，我只是..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1288
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_216d290a:

    # robin "I don't like being in the dark."
    robin "我不喜欢待在黑暗中。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1289
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_9d1e7659:

    # pro "Hey, it's okay. You're safe, okay?"
    pro "嘿，没关系。你很安全，好吗？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1290
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_0fca7e6b:

    # pro "I won't let anything bad happen to you, I promise."
    pro "我不会让任何不好的事情发生在你身上，我保证。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1291
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_7f17a9e7:

    # "I can feel his body relaxing slowly as he gets used to the dim light."
    "我能感觉到他的身体在慢慢放松，适应了昏暗的光线。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1292
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_222fd6f0:

    # pro "It's okay, we just need to wait until the power comes back on."
    pro "没关系，我们只需要等待电源恢复即可。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1293
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_3351615d:

    # robin "S-sorry about falling on top of you like that..."
    robin "抱歉，就这样倒在你身上……"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1294
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_af94f9cb:

    # pro "No worries..."
    pro "不用担心..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1297
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_ec2c854c:

    # "He slowly gets off of me and sits up again."
    "他慢慢地从我身上下来，又坐了起来。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1301
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_294c5cbd:

    # "Robin looks so scared."
    "罗宾看起来很害怕。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1302
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_d9e308e6:

    # "His face is pale and he's shaking a little bit."
    "他脸色苍白，身体有些颤抖。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1303
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_fc2d0705_1:

    # pro "Hey, it's okay."
    pro "嘿，没关系。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1304
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_7dd06f9b:

    # pro "I'm sure the power will be back on soon."
    pro "我确信电力很快就会恢复。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1305
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_eac7b47a:

    # pro "And remember, I'm right here with you."
    pro "请记住，我就在你身边。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1306
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_052f66f1:

    # robin "It's just..."
    robin "这只是..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1307
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_e464d7c6:

    # robin "The knock on the door the other night... it felt like I was alone with that stalker all over again."
    robin "那天晚上的敲门声……感觉就像我又和那个跟踪狂单独在一起了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1309
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_8927c4a2:

    # robin "It sounds dumb, but that's how I feel..."
    robin "听起来很愚蠢，但这就是我的感觉......"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1311
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_57fb94c5:

    # pro "It's not dumb, Robin. You have every right to be scared."
    pro "这并不傻，罗宾。你完全有权利感到害怕。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1312
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_019b8370:

    # pro "That experience was really traumatic, and you're still processing it."
    pro "那次经历真的很痛苦，而你仍在处理它。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1313
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_7d3c9c59:

    # pro "Just know that I'm here for you, okay?"
    pro "只要知道我在这里等你就可以了，好吗？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1314
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_425b462e:

    # robin "Right..."
    robin "正确的..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1315
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_163f216b:

    # robin "What do you usually do when something scares you?"
    robin "当有事情让你害怕时你通常会做什么？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1316
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_04ef7531:

    # pro "Well, I guess I just try to distract myself."
    pro "好吧，我想我只是想分散自己的注意力。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1317
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_7f0e2d37:

    # pro "Watch some TV or play a video game or something."
    pro "看一些电视或者玩电子游戏什么的。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1318
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_61a13781:

    # robin "Those are things I can't really do right now though..."
    robin "这些是我现在确实做不到的事情......"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1320
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_328ae532:

    # robin "Want to just talk instead? Maybe that will help me calm down a little."
    robin "想只是谈谈吗？也许这会帮助我冷静一点。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1322
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_b2e7892c:

    # pro "Sure, what do you want to talk about?"
    pro "当然，你想谈什么？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1323
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_b6b06181:

