    pro "有时事情会出乎意料地发生。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1374
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_e92b6384:

    # pro "Like us, we were complete strangers when you first moved in."
    pro "和我们一样，当你刚搬进来时，我们也是完全陌生的。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1375
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_7464c56d:

    # pro "Now, you're one of the closest friends I have."
    pro "现在，你是我最亲密的朋友之一。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1376
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_68d7b9aa:

    # robin "Yeah, that's true."
    robin "是的，确实如此。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1378
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_970ac64e:

    # robin "I'm glad we became friends."
    robin "我很高兴我们成为朋友。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1379
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_4a8af8d0:

    # robin "You make me feel so... comfortable."
    robin "你让我感觉如此……舒服。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1380
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_e7c88bc3:

    # robin "I don't know how you do it."
    robin "我不知道你是怎么做到的。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1381
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_e82f048d:

    # pro "It's a gift."
    pro "这是一份礼物。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1382
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_fad03f8a:

    # "We laugh together, and for a moment the fear of the dark subsides."
    "我们一起笑，一时间对黑暗的恐惧消退了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1385
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_776782d0:

    # robin "Can I... ask you for something?"
    robin "我可以...向你求一件事吗？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1386
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_087f9b10:

    # pro "Of course, what is it?"
    pro "当然，那是什么？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1387
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_0f0aad54:

    # robin "If you wouldn't mind, can I sleep in your room tonight?"
    robin "如果你不介意的话，今晚我可以睡在你的房间吗？"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1388
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_d5239721:

    # robin "If the power doesn't come back on, of course!"
    robin "当然，如果电源没有恢复的话！"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1391
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_3fb05efa:

    # "His face flushes with embarrassment. It's adorable."
