    "我深吸一口气，尝试放松。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1446
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_6ec23e2b:

    # pro "I'll always be here for you, Robin. No matter what."
    pro "我会永远在你身边，罗宾。无论。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1447
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_43d64dd0:

    # robin "I know. It's just, after what happened at my old place..."
    robin "我知道。只是，在我老家发生了那件事之后……"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1448
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_6ba7eb27:

    # robin "I really didn't want to let myself get attached to anyone."
    robin "我真的不想让自己依附于任何人。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1449
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_bfb17953:

    # robin "But with you..."
    robin "但和你一起..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:1450
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_e26757fc:

    # robin "I feel like I can trust you, and that means a lot to me."
    robin "我觉得我可以信任你，这对我来说意义重大。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1451
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_0e0c8c7b:

    # robin "Sorry if that's cringey or whatever."
    robin "抱歉，如果这有点尴尬或其他什么。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1452
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_1480278f:

    # robin "I had to get it off my chest."
    robin "我必须把它从心里吐出来。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1453
translate chinese_simplified story_beat4_6e3b4577:

    # pro "No worries. I'm glad you feel that way about me."
    pro "不用担心。我很高兴你对我有这样的感觉。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:1454
