    pro "我们不会受伤。我保证。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2389
translate chinese_simplified story_beat6_b5e5cee4:

    # robin "You can't guarantee that... no one can."
    robin "你不能保证……没有人能保证。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2390
translate chinese_simplified story_beat6_e7f591e1:

    # robin "I need to go somewhere he won't find me, and then maybe we'll be safe."
    robin "我需要去一个他找不到我的地方，然后也许我们就安全了。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2391
translate chinese_simplified story_beat6_dc6dc9d0:

    # "I have to make a decision, I have to say something."
    "我必须做出决定，我必须说点什么。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2392
translate chinese_simplified story_beat6_43db7b2c:

    # "Until I make a choice for Robin, he'll continue to spiral."
    "在我为罗宾做出选择之前，他将继续螺旋式上升。"

# game/storybeat.rpy:2447
translate chinese_simplified story_beat6_ec012af7:

    # "What should I do?"
    "我应该怎么办？"

