    robin "今天我们应该玩什么游戏呢，嗯..."

# game/storybeat.rpy:2540
translate chinese_simplified ending1_553656f5:

    # robin "My roommate isn't home, so I can be as loud as I want."
    robin "我的室友不在家，所以我可以随心所欲地大声说话。"

